				{
					"id": 411141503,
					"content": "莫娜真厉害。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141504
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411141504,
					"content": "当然了！派蒙，你也觉得我很厉害对吧？对吧对吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141505,
					"content": "是啊是啊，没有莫娜，我们恐怕会陷入更大的麻烦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141506,
					"content": "哼，听见没有！愚人众执行官！坏男人！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141507,
					"content": "不过看他刚才那么震惊的样子，也不像在撒谎。难道师父教导我占星术时所说的「虚假之天」还有其他含义？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141508,
					"content": "啊…咳咳，我走神了。那么，去完成我们最重要的工作吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141509,
					"content": "<color=#00E1FFFF>陨石的核心</color>，一定就在这里附近！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4111416,
			"completionStepIds": [
				4111416
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"4111416",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 4111416,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"莫娜"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 411141601,
					"content": "哇，这就是核心吗，和其他陨石不太一样呢！有种…明亮的感觉？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141602,
					"content": "这块石头上有着惊人的元素力和意念。确实是核心没错。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141603,
					"content": "我们…应该破坏它吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141604
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411141604,
					"content": "嗯，不把它清理掉，人们就不会醒来……这块核心就是一切事件的根源。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141605,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，加油啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141606,
					"content": "没想到，原来是这么一回事…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141607,
						411141608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141607,
					"content": "攀爬的人，试图抵达未知的高峰。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141609
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411141609,
					"content": "人类的信念，竟然可以在天空中留存千年…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141610,
					"content": "哎，果然占星学是个厉害的东西呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141611,
					"content": "为什么突然说到这上面去了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141612,
					"content": "能和星星交流，就能掌握从古到今所有秘密，当然啦，能做到这种事的占星术士除了我也没有几个。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141613,
					"content": "莫娜，这次太谢谢你了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141614
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411141614,
					"content": "干、干嘛啊，突然这么认真…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141615,
					"content": "话说回来，那个叫菲谢尔的女孩子，还真是神奇。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141616,
					"content": "我也觉得！她明明…呃…怎么说呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141617,
						411141618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141617,
					"content": "是个充满奇思妙想的人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141619
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411141619,
					"content": "虽然是这样啦，但你回忆一下…她说的好像也没错呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141620,
					"content": "难道说，她就是那种用错误过程得出正确结果的人？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141621,
					"content": "说不定真是这样。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141622
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141622,
					"content": "我最没想到的是，尖帽子峰居然变成了一座小岛！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141623
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141623,
					"content": "过去的高山成了海中一块小小的陆地。现在的蒙德人只要坐上船，几乎都能到那里吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141624
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141624,
					"content": "那岂不是人人都能登上尖帽子峰了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141625
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141625,
					"content": "人人都能抵达山顶了呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141626
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411141626,
					"content": "莱纳德会高兴吗？虽然尖帽子峰是个意外，但现在的蒙德人在风神帮助下已经能够飞翔了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141627
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141627,
					"content": "有了翅膀，人就能去到更高更远的地方，探索更多未知的角落。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141628
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141628,
					"content": "（莱纳德，你的心愿实现了吗？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141629
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411141629,
					"content": "好了，处理完陨石核心，睡着的人一定会慢慢醒来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141630
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141630,
					"content": "我们也算是顺利完成了冒险家协会的委托吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141631
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411141631,
					"content": "嗯，希望大家…早日恢复。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 411141618,
					"content": "是个异想天开的怪人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141619
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411141608,
					"content": "执着的人，愿将意志传递给未来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411141609
					]
				}
			]
		}
	]
}